<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52915" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμαξ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[κᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰκος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ </span>(ὁ in <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			171
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			6.165
		</span></i>, cf. infr. <i><span class="en">
			3
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vine-pole,
			vine-prop</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.563
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				299
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>any pole</i> or <i>shaft</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πεύκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					171
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρσου Χλοερὸν κ</span>.
				<u>AP</u>l.c. (<i><span class="en">
				Phal.
			</span></i>); in an engine of war, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				171.8
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>shaft of a spear</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				66
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				1155
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				852
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				404
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χαλκέαι κάμακες</span>, with
			rings at the top, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.6.2
			</span></i> (masc. in this sense, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				487.38
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>tiller</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nav.</u>
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερκίς</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.247
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b> in pl.,
				<i>steering-paddles</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				4.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>7.</b>
			<i>tent-pole</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.218
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>8.</b>
			<i>perch</i> for fowls, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				14.7.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.24.5
			</span></i>.</div>
